    "about": "Fitted to the game's HOME capture (refs main-menu.png, band-averaged rows 0 to 60 at ten points from x 650 to 1880; mean error 11 of 255): the record's units for the haze are not the site's. The pills are no longer fitted: they are the material's EmissiveIntensity in nits (1,500), as Frostbite's emissive is, far over white at the front end's EV 8 (-0.35), which is why the game's are white with a halo; the capture they had been fitted to was taken off an HDR swap chain (DisplayMappingHdr10PeakLuma 5000.5) and clipped, so its band averages were low (bf2-re findings/53).",
